answer/id #uuid "d3a43103-bf7b-525c-95cb-71da87d6c0ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449748} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3618720-e80e-5dc7-a706-380306c42caa" :answer-field/key "The set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450828}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "3b60b8aa-49bb-5ecd-ad04-b68a0c43f769" :question/math-academy-id "q-157225" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3}=0.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}+3{a}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -20\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+0+0 \\\\ 5+0-9 \\\\ -2-20+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -19\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} &=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement “The set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true, the set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275383 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119924 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7eb5ca50-e9f3-5513-aff1-1ada8c225a42" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Linearly Independent Sets by Inspection"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} {:answer/id #uuid "ec3f999c-abdd-5a87-9204-4b13bfc2361d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c0d7ec0-7274-56ea-8e17-5dc902e217cf" :answer-field/key "$-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450829} {:answe