1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2}$ and ${v}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}{v}_{3}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3}=0.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}+5{a}_{3} & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+5\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ 20 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2+0+15 \\\\ -7-10+20 \\\\ 0+0+5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}7{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{3} &=0 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” is true, the set $\\{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=0$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275384 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119924 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7eb5ca50-e9f3-5513-aff1-1ada8c225a42" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Linearly Independent Sets by Inspection"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb3566f6-5648-5ded-a3f6-a1f68bddbb41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449756} {:answer/id #uuid "dc5d08b2-9024-5b11-99ac-9eb20963ee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc5d08b2-9024-5b11-99ac-9eb20963ee53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449757} :answer-field/id #uuid "e73a4373-d621-5f35-a808-178c8861a82d" :answer-field/key "${a}_{1}-3{a}_{2}+{a}_{3}=0.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450832} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "39303f9a-ace3-5e34-bf37-934e599096fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449758} {:answer/id #uuid "1472f8c2-9b6a-5097-9017-33f0242406ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449759}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39303f9a-ace3-5e34-bf37-934e599096fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449758} :answer-field/id #uuid "dd161512-1834-5429-aed2-d20e54240f92" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{a}_